msgstr "Modan2에서 데이터셋이란 무엇인가요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:213
msgid "A **dataset** is a collection of objects (specimens) with shared:"
msgstr "**데이터셋** 은 다음을 공유하는 객체(표본)들의 모음입니다:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:215
msgid "Number of landmarks"
msgstr "랜드마크 개수"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:216
