msgstr "변수 정의 (측정값, 범주)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:218
msgid "Wireframe/baseline/polygon definitions"
msgstr "와이어프레임/베이스라인/폴리곤 정의"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:219
msgid "Analysis settings"
msgstr "분석 설정"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:221
msgid ""
"Datasets can have **parent-child relationships** for hierarchical "
"organization."
msgstr "데이터셋은 계층적 구성을 위해 **상위-하위 관계** 를 가질 수 있습니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:224
msgid "How do parent-child datasets work?"
msgstr "상위-하위 데이터셋은 어떻게 동작하나요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:226
msgid "**Parent dataset:**"
msgstr "**상위 데이터셋:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:228
msgid "Contains original landmark data"
msgstr "원본 랜드마크 데이터를 담습니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:229
msgid "Defines basic structure (landmark count, dimension)"
msgstr "기본 구조(랜드마크 개수, 차원)를 정의합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:231
msgid "**Child dataset:**"
msgstr "**하위 데이터셋:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:233
msgid "A new, empty dataset nested under the parent"
msgstr "상위 아래에 중첩되는 새 빈 데이터셋입니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:234
msgid "Objects are not copied into it — you populate it yourself"
msgstr "객체가 복사되어 들어오지는 않으며, 직접 채워 넣습니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:235
msgid "Has its own landmark count, dimension, and variables"
msgstr "자체 랜드마크 개수, 차원, 변수를 가집니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:237
#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:534
msgid "**Use cases:**"
msgstr "**활용 사례:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:239
msgid "Organise a study into subgroups"
msgstr "연구를 하위 그룹으로 나누어 구성"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:240
msgid "Keep related datasets together in the tree"
msgstr "관련 데이터셋을 트리에서 함께 묶어 관리"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:243
msgid "What is the difference between objects and datasets?"
msgstr "객체와 데이터셋의 차이는 무엇인가요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:245
msgid "**Dataset:**"
msgstr "**데이터셋:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:247
msgid "Container for multiple objects"
msgstr "여러 객체를 담는 컨테이너"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:248
msgid "Defines structure (landmark count, dimension, variables)"
msgstr "구조(랜드마크 개수, 차원, 변수)를 정의"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:249
msgid "Settings for visualization and analysis"
msgstr "시각화와 분석 설정"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:251
msgid "**Object:**"
msgstr "**객체:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:253
msgid "Individual specimen"
msgstr "개별 표본"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:254
msgid "Contains landmark coordinates"
msgstr "랜드마크 좌표를 가짐"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:255
msgid "Can have attached image or 3D model"
msgstr "이미지나 3D 모델을 첨부할 수 있음"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:256
msgid "Has variable values (measurements, categories)"
msgstr "변수 값(측정값, 범주)을 가짐"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:258
msgid "**Relationship:** Dataset contains multiple objects"
msgstr "**관계:** 데이터셋은 여러 객체를 포함합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:261
msgid "How many landmarks can I use?"
msgstr "랜드마크는 몇 개까지 쓸 수 있나요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:263
msgid "**Practical limits:**"
msgstr "**실용적 한계:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:265
msgid "**2D:** Up to 1000 landmarks per object (tested)"
msgstr "**2D:** 객체당 최대 1000개 (검증됨)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:266
msgid "**3D:** Up to 1000 landmarks per object (tested)"
msgstr "**3D:** 객체당 최대 1000개 (검증됨)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:267
msgid "**Objects:** Tested with 2,000 objects successfully"
msgstr "**객체:** 2,000개까지 정상 동작 확인"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:269
msgid "**Performance:**"
msgstr "**성능:**"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:271
msgid "100 landmarks, 1000 objects: Excellent performance"
msgstr "랜드마크 100개, 객체 1000개: 우수한 성능"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:272
msgid "Memory usage scales linearly (~4KB per object)"
msgstr "메모리 사용량은 선형으로 증가 (객체당 약 4KB)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:273
msgid "Analysis time depends on landmark count and algorithm"
msgstr "분석 시간은 랜드마크 개수와 알고리즘에 따라 달라짐"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:276
msgid "Can I have missing landmarks?"
msgstr "결측 랜드마크가 있어도 되나요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:278
msgid "**Yes!** Modan2 supports missing landmarks:"
msgstr "**네!** Modan2는 결측 랜드마크를 지원합니다:"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:280
msgid ""
"Mark one in the object dialog with **\"Add Missing\"** / **\"Insert "
"Missing\"**, or by typing ``MISSING`` into a coordinate cell (a blank cell "
"counts as missing)"
msgstr ""
"객체 대화상자에서 **\"결측 추가\"**\\ (Add Missing) / **\"결측 삽입\"**\\ (Insert Missing)으로"
" 표시하거나, 좌표 셀에 ``MISSING`` 을 입력하세요(빈 셀도 결측으로 간주)"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:282
msgid ""
"The viewer draws a hollow circle at each missing landmark's estimated "
"position while **\"Show Estimated\"** is ticked"
msgstr "**\"추정값 보기\"**\\ (Show Estimated)가 켜져 있으면 뷰어가 각 결측 랜드마크의 추정 위치에 빈 원을 그립니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:284
msgid ""
"Marking a landmark missing keeps the landmark count consistent across the "
"dataset, which is what analysis requires"
msgstr "랜드마크를 결측으로 표시하면 데이터셋 전체에서 랜드마크 개수가 일관되게 유지되며, 이는 분석에 필요한 조건입니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:287
msgid ""
"**How they are estimated:** Modan2 fits the dataset's mean shape onto the "
"landmarks a specimen actually has — matching rotation, scale, and position —"
" and reads the missing positions off the fitted mean. During analysis this "
"is repeated as the alignment settles (an EM-style loop), and the imputed "
"values are used only in the analysis working copy, never written back to "
"your data."
msgstr ""
"**추정 방식:** Modan2는 데이터셋의 평균 형상을 해당 표본이 실제로 가진 랜드마크에 맞춰 정합하고 — 회전, 크기, 위치를 "
"맞춥니다 — 정합된 평균 형상에서 결측 위치를 읽어옵니다. 분석 중에는 정렬이 수렴하는 동안 이 과정을 반복하며(EM 방식 루프), "
"대치된 값은 분석용 작업 사본에서만 쓰이고 사용자 데이터에 기록되지 않습니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:293
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Best practice:** keep missing data under about 10% of landmarks, and keep "
"a good number of complete specimens."
msgstr "**권장 사항:** 결측 데이터는 전체 랜드마크의 약 10% 미만으로 유지하고, 완전한 표본을 충분히 확보하세요."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:297
msgid "Can I capture curves instead of individual points?"
msgstr "개별 점 대신 곡선을 기록할 수 있나요?"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:299
msgid "**Yes — semi-landmark curves** (2D only for now)."
msgstr "**네 — 준랜드마크 곡선** 을 쓰면 됩니다(현재는 2D 전용)."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:301
msgid ""
"You define a curve once for the dataset, with a name and a point count "
"``N``, then trace it on each specimen. Modan2 resamples the trace into ``N``"
" evenly-spaced points along its length, and analysis treats those points "
"like ordinary landmarks, appended after the fixed (anatomical) ones."
msgstr ""
"곡선은 데이터셋 수준에서 이름과 점 개수 ``N`` 을 지정해 한 번만 정의한 뒤, 표본마다 추적합니다. Modan2는 추적선을 길이를 "
"따라 균등한 간격의 ``N`` 개 점으로 재표본화하며, 분석에서는 이 점들을 일반 랜드마크처럼 다루어 고정(해부학적) 랜드마크 뒤에 이어"
" 붙입니다."

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:306
msgid "Trace in the object dialog's **Curve** mode"
msgstr "객체 대화상자의 **Curve** 모드에서 추적합니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:307
msgid ""
"**\"Snap to curve\"** (on by default) follows the strongest image edge "
"between your clicks, so a clean outline takes only a few points"
msgstr ""
"**\"Snap to curve\"**\\ (기본 켜짐)가 클릭 사이에서 이미지의 가장 강한 경계를 따라가므로, 깔끔한 윤곽선을 점 몇 "
"개로 얻을 수 있습니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:309
msgid ""
"Editing ``N`` later re-resamples the stored trace — no need to re-trace"
msgstr "나중에 ``N`` 을 수정하면 저장된 추적선을 다시 재표본화하므로 다시 추적할 필요가 없습니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:310
msgid ""
"Curves round-trip through TPS (``CURVES=`` blocks) and the JSON+ZIP package"
msgstr "곡선은 TPS(``CURVES=`` 블록)와 JSON+ZIP 패키지를 통해 왕복 변환됩니다"

#: ../../../../../../mnt/d/projects/Modan2/docs/manual/faq.rst:311
msgid ""
"A dataset can be analyzed with only semi-landmarks and no fixed landmarks"
